#. Using NIS and LDAP simultaneously is not supported (#36981).
#: src/include/nis/ui.rb:542
msgid ""
"When you configure your machine as a NIS client,\n"
"you cannot retrieve the user data from LDAP.\n"
"Are you sure?"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານເປັນລູກຂ່າຍ NIS,\n"
"ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈາກ LDAP ໄດ້.\n"
"ທ່ານແນ່ໃຈບໍ່?"

#. help text 1/4
#: src/include/nis/ui.rb:622
msgid ""
"<p>Normally, it is possible for any host to query which server a client is "
"using. Disabling <b>Answer Remote Hosts</b> restricts this only to the local "
"host.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໂຮສໃດກໍສາມາດສອບຖາມໄດ້ວ່າລູກຂ່າຍກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຊີເວີໃດຢູ່. ການປິດ <b>ຕອບສະໜອງໂຮສທາງ"
"ໄກ</b> ຈະຈຳກັດໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂຮສພາຍໃນເທົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#. help text 2/4
#. Check, ie. turn on a check box
#: src/include/nis/ui.rb:631
msgid ""
"<p>Check <b>Broken server</b> if answers from servers running on an "
"unprivileged port should be accepted. It is a security risk and it is better "
"to replace such a server.</p>"
msgstr ""
